{"id":"9ce31aa7ab297872","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/050_Frege_证明系统.md","title":"050 Frege 证明系统","display":"050_Frege_证明系统","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-对象语言与模式语言\">1. 对象语言与模式语言</h1>\n<p>对象命题变元集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>模式变量集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{MVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{MVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且二者不交。对象公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>模式公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\">\\(\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{MVar}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{MVar}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\">\\(P\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\">\\(P,Q\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\)</span>，则 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\in\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>原始构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom},\\operatorname{neg},\\operatorname{imp}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>与</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar},\\operatorname{pneg},\\operatorname{pimp}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mvar},\\operatorname{pneg},\\operatorname{pimp}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-替换与实例化\">2. 替换与实例化</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{Prop})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(\\operatorname{atom}(p))=\\{p\\},\n\\quad\n\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(\\operatorname{neg}(A))=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(\\operatorname{imp}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}_{F}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Subst}_{F}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{Subst}_{F}=\\{\\sigma:\\mathsf{Prop}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\}\\)</span>。定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{F}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}_{F}:\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\times\\mathsf{Subst}_{F}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{F}(A,\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{F}(A,\\sigma)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\sigma\">\\(A\\sigma\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\sigma=\\sigma(p),\\quad\n\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\sigma=\\operatorname{neg}(A\\sigma),\\quad\n\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\sigma=\\operatorname{imp}(A\\sigma,B\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F}=\\{\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F}=\\{\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\}\\)</span>。定义实例化函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}:\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\times\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}:\\mathsf{Pat}_{F}\\times\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下，记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(P,\\theta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(P,\\theta)\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\theta\">\\(P\\theta\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\theta=\\theta(X),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{mvar}(X)\\theta=\\theta(X),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\theta=\\operatorname{neg}(P\\theta),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\theta=\\operatorname{imp}(P\\theta,Q\\theta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pneg}(P)\\theta=\\operatorname{neg}(P\\theta),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{pimp}(P,Q)\\theta=\\operatorname{imp}(P\\theta,Q\\theta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>无绑定构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^{F}\">\\(\\equiv_\\alpha^{F}\\)</span> 是公式相等。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-Frege-基础模式\">3. Frege 基础模式</h1>\n<p>固定两两不同的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{MVar}\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{MVar}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>公理模式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{APat}_{F}\">\\(\\mathsf{APat}_{F}\\)</span> 定义为下列三个模式公式组成的集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z)))),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Z)))),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)),\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{pimp}(\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X)),\\operatorname{pneg}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(Y),\\operatorname{mvar}(X))).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Frege 公理公式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}\n=\n\\{P\\theta:P\\in\\mathsf{APat}_{F},\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}\n=\n\\{P\\theta:P\\in\\mathsf{APat}_{F},\\theta:\\mathsf{MVar}\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则模式集合只含分离模式：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RPat}_{F}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl(\n(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{RPat}_{F}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl(\n(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{pimp}(\\operatorname{mvar}(X),\\operatorname{mvar}(Y))),\n\\operatorname{mvar}(Y)\n\\bigr)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>规则实例关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}^{MP}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(P_0,\\theta),\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(P_1,\\theta)),\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(Q,\\theta)\\bigr):\n((P_0,P_1),Q)\\in\\mathsf{RPat}_{F},\\ \\theta\\in\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F}\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}^{MP}\n=\n\\left\\{\n\\bigl((\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(P_0,\\theta),\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(P_1,\\theta)),\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}(Q,\\theta)\\bigr):\n((P_0,P_1),Q)\\in\\mathsf{RPat}_{F},\\ \\theta\\in\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F}\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}^{MP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}^{MP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-证明与大小\">4. 证明与大小</h1>\n<p>Frege 证明是非空有限序列</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}\">\\(p(k)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}\\)</span>；</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A\">\\(p(i)=A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\">\\(p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(k)=B\">\\(p(k)=B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>公式大小函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\cdot|_F:\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\to\\mathbb N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\cdot|_F:\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\to\\mathbb N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>逐构造子定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|_F=1,\n\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|_F=1+|A|_F,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{atom}(p)|_F=1,\n\\qquad\n|\\operatorname{neg}(A)|_F=1+|A|_F,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|_F=1+|A|_F+|B|_F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|\\operatorname{imp}(A,B)|_F=1+|A|_F+|B|_F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>证明大小为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"|p|_F=\\sum_{k&lt;n}|p(k)|_F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[|p|_F=\\sum_{k&lt;n}|p(k)|_F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Frege 主判断 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{Frege}A\">\\(\\vdash_{Frege}A\\)</span> 在第 7 节由证明谓词和末行谓词共同定义。</p>\n<h1 id=\"5.-行许可谓词\">5. 行许可谓词</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AxLine}_{F}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AxLine}_{F}(B)\\Longleftrightarrow B\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{F}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLine}_{F}(p,k)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MLine}_{F}(p,k)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j&lt;k\">\\(i,j&lt;k\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p(i)=A,\\qquad p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad p(k)=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p(i)=A,\\qquad p(j)=\\operatorname{imp}(A,B),\\qquad p(k)=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明谓词\">6. 证明谓词</h1>\n<p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{F}(p)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{F}(p)\\)</span> 当且仅当 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\">\\(p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&gt;0\">\\(n&gt;0\\)</span>，且每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k&lt;n\">\\(k&lt;n\\)</span> 满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AxLine}_{F}(p(k))\\quad\\lor\\quad\\operatorname{MLine}_{F}(p,k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AxLine}_{F}(p(k))\\quad\\lor\\quad\\operatorname{MLine}_{F}(p,k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-主判断\">7. 主判断</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vdash_{Frege}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{F}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{F}(p,A)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vdash_{Frege}A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\,\\bigl(\\operatorname{Proof}_{F}(p)\\wedge\n\\operatorname{Last}_{F}(p,A)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>其中</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Last}_{F}(p,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(n&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\wedge p(n-1)=A\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Last}_{F}(p,A)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\,\n\\bigl(n&gt;0\\wedge p:n\\to\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}\\wedge p(n-1)=A\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>行许可谓词等价于</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AxLine}_{F}(p(k))\n\\lor\n\\exists i,j&lt;k\\,((p(i),p(j)),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}^{MP}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{AxLine}_{F}(p(k))\n\\lor\n\\exists i,j&lt;k\\,((p(i),p(j)),p(k))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{F}^{MP}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>后承闭包为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cn}_{F}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}:\\vdash_{Frege}A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cn}_{F}=\\{A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}:\\vdash_{Frege}A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-目标差异\">8. 目标差异</h1>\n<p>目标区分对象定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_F\n=\n(\\mathsf{Pat}_{F},\\mathsf{APat}_{F},\\mathsf{RPat}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{F},\\mathsf{Ax}_{F},\\mathsf{Rule}_{F},\\operatorname{Proof}_{F}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_F\n=\n(\\mathsf{Pat}_{F},\\mathsf{APat}_{F},\\mathsf{RPat}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{F},\\mathsf{Ax}_{F},\\mathsf{Rule}_{F},\\operatorname{Proof}_{F}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>公理和规则先由有限模式对象给出，再由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}\">\\(\\operatorname{Inst}_{F}\\)</span> 生成对象公式实例；证明中没有扩展定义行或显式命题替换规则。</p>\n<h1 id=\"9.-整个形式系统\">9. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{Frege}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{MVar},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{F},\n\\mathsf{Pat}_{F},\n\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{F},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{F},\n\\mathsf{APat}_{F},\n\\mathsf{RPat}_{F},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{F},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{F},\n|\\cdot|_F,\n\\vdash_{Frege},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{F},\n\\Delta_F\n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{Frege}\n=\n(\n\\mathsf{Prop},\n\\mathsf{MVar},\n\\mathsf{Fm}_{F},\n\\mathsf{Pat}_{F},\n\\mathsf{InstSub}_{F},\n\\operatorname{FV}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Sub}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Inst}_{F},\n\\equiv_\\alpha^{F},\n\\mathsf{APat}_{F},\n\\mathsf{RPat}_{F},\n\\mathsf{Ax}_{F},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{F},\n\\operatorname{Last}_{F},\n|\\cdot|_F,\n\\vdash_{Frege},\n\\mathsf{Cn}_{F},\n\\Delta_F\n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含有限公理模式实例、分离规则实例和有限证明序列；不含扩展定义行、替换推理规则或电路语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-对象语言与模式语言","text":"1. 对象语言与模式语言","level":1},{"id":"2.-替换与实例化","text":"2. 替换与实例化","level":1},{"id":"3.-Frege-基础模式","text":"3. Frege 基础模式","level":1},{"id":"4.-证明与大小","text":"4. 证明与大小","level":1},{"id":"5.-行许可谓词","text":"5. 行许可谓词","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明谓词","text":"6. 证明谓词","level":1},{"id":"7.-主判断","text":"7. 主判断","level":1},{"id":"8.-目标差异","text":"8. 目标差异","level":1},{"id":"9.-整个形式系统","text":"9. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{Prop}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{MVar}=\\{X_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\},","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atom}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{neg}(A)\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Fm}_{F}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operat